Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,111)}Memorization Bread for the Exams!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs29\)\pos(280,563)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon, I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a problem and yet you ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Good question!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, there are Japanese and maths exams tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why you are carrying your pillow and water kettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.48,0:00:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Although It has nothing to do with the exams..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short, I'm in a big trouble now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.73,0:00:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.65,0:00:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me that you are going to just sit there and do nothing, do you, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.53,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm probably going to get 0-marks...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.33,0:01:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just use this fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Use that fan to blow off the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but wait, what's blowing off school about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't blow off my school, gimme something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about using the animal light to turn your teacher into a gorilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.99,0:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around and be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.74,0:01:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who don't study hard it's your own fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.20,0:01:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I will study hard, so please rescue me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.75,0:01:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get 0 in my exams, I will run away from house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.34,0:01:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so hopeless, let me use the Memorisation Bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.67,0:01:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Memorisation Bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.13,0:02:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Press the bread on to the book and the content will get memorised by the bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.81,0:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then swallow it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be able to remember everything that's written on a page.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.90,0:02:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna try?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.77,0:02:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,_ x2=6?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,3
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.19,0:02:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,_x5=10?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.66,0:02:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just memorize all the exercises from textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be able to write exams easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme more!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can get 100 marks on the exams now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.30,0:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I tore a very important page!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I tore it to use as tissue paper to sneeze on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose bag is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.31,0:02:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to memorize my friend's notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.31,0:02:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you please get me more Memorisation Bread? I'm gonna visit my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I study hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't want my notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's really hard to eat this kind of Memorisation Bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s notebook is always this clean, I am going to memorise it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be that hard if everything is this easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.09,0:03:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am quite good at memorizing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But you are the most forgetful person in class. You don't say....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,OK, let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll eat up this telephone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.61,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I can memorize all on the first page.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Test me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.95,0:03:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please start!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.83,0:03:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Name it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No. of Ai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,1234567
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.38,0:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! You are right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No. of Ms. Fukiku Keiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,9999876
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it's hard not to get 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, as long as I have this bread, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.85,0:04:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, feel free to have some snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have brought lots of Mochi, so help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochi is very tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can eat a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just eating and reading Manga, when are you gonna study?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to eat more Memorisation Bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.00,0:04:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to let the food in my stomach get digested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.34,0:04:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You have eaten too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.05,0:04:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, can I borrow your notebook?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you hungry, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who wanted to eat cheeseburger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:04:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}must{\i0} eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a special big one for you, so dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Special big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm full!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, have you memorized everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.38,0:05:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you tons of Memorisation Bread, but you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You forced me to do things I don't wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.01,0:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, but please don't get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have borrowed the notebook back, I will eat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some water and swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I really can't do this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,is it OK to have 0 on your exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.99,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I will let you eat all of them by any means.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.21,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita has been in the bathroom from an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He ate too much and is having stomach ache now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.43,0:06:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You pooped all the pages you ate...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have to re-eat from page 1 now!
